# Types in this directory are registered through this qmldir. Every root-level
# component must be listed here: once a qmldir exists, unlisted .qml files in
# the same directory are no longer registered implicitly.
#
# The singletons are listed so that static tooling (qmllint, qmlls) resolves
# `Niri.` / `Stats.` / `Tasks.` as singleton instances instead of reporting every
# member access as a missing property.
singleton Niri 1.0 Niri.qml
singleton Stats 1.0 Stats.qml
singleton Tasks 1.0 Tasks.qml
Bar 1.0 Bar.qml
NotificationPopup 1.0 NotificationPopup.qml
